---
source: system/tests/help.rs
expression: "help_output(\"eject\")"
---
Eject removable media

Usage: eject [OPTIONS] [DEVICE]

Arguments:
  [DEVICE]  Device or mountpoint to eject

Options:
  -d, --default                    Display default device name
  -F, --force                      Force eject, skip device type check
  -f, --floppy                     Use floppy eject method
  -i, --manualeject <MANUALEJECT>  Lock or unlock hardware eject button (on|off)
  -M, --no-partitions-unmount      Don't unmount other partitions on the device
  -m, --no-unmount                 Don't unmount the device before ejecting
  -n, --noop                       Show device but take no action
  -q, --tape                       Use tape drive offline command
  -r, --cdrom                      Use CD-ROM eject command
  -s, --scsi                       Use SCSI eject commands
  -T, --traytoggle                 Open the tray if it is closed, or close it if it is open
  -t, --trayclose                  Close CD-ROM tray
  -v, --verbose                    Verbose output
  -h, --help                       Print help
